{"id":"521d1975363681b1","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-matchedcover.md","title":"Quadratic zero equations and minimum vertex covers","display":"thm-matchedcover — Quadratic zero equations and minimum vertex covers","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-matchedcover","aliases":["27-thm-matchedcover"],"display":"thm-matchedcover — Quadratic zero equations and minimum vertex covers","depends_on":["[[27-df-matchedgraph]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4.2","source_statement":"Theorem 5.3, vertex-cover formulation and proof","source_printed_pages":"211–212","source_pdf_pages":"235–236","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-matchedcover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-matchedcover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-matchedcover — Quadratic zero equations and minimum vertex covers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"198879e40a0ec5d9\" href=\"?note=198879e40a0ec5d9\" title=\"27-df-matchedgraph\">27-df-matchedgraph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 5.3, vertex-cover formulation and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"211–212"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"235–236"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\varnothing\\notin D\">\\(T_\\varnothing\\notin D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCover}(D),\\tau_M(D),C_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MCover}(D),\\tau_M(D),C_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"198879e40a0ec5d9\" href=\"?note=198879e40a0ec5d9\" title=\"27-df-matchedgraph\">27-df-matchedgraph</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 取该依赖中的 DNF 语义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_M(D)\\geq n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(|C_n(a)|=n\\land(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=0\\Longleftrightarrow C_n(a)\\in\\mathrm{MCover}(D))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_M(D)\\geq n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(|C_n(a)|=n\\land(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=0\\Longleftrightarrow C_n(a)\\in\\mathrm{MCover}(D))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=0)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\tau_M(D)=n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=0)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\tau_M(D)=n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 5.3 的 vertex-cover 形式，pp.211–212 陈述与证明已核对。n 条不交 null edges 迫使每个 cover 至少有 n 个文字；C_n(a) 在每条 null edge 中恰取一个端点。它覆盖项边当且仅当该项至少有一个假文字，即 D 在 a 上为 0。反向若 cover 大小为 n，就在每对互补文字中恰取一个，以该文字为假唯一确定赋值；所有项边均被覆盖，所以此赋值解 D=0。无需对含 loops 的 matching 另作约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-matchedgraph","status":"resolved","id":"198879e40a0ec5d9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-matchedgraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-matchedgraph","status":"resolved","id":"198879e40a0ec5d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$ 且 $T_\\varnothing\\notin D$；$\\mathrm{MCover}(D),\\tau_M(D),C_n$（see [[27-df-matchedgraph]]），$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 取该依赖中的 DNF 语义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\varnothing\\notin D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCover}(D),\\tau_M(D),C_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_M(D)\\geq n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(|C_n(a)|=n\\land(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=0\\Longleftrightarrow C_n(a)\\in\\mathrm{MCover}(D))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)(a)=0)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\tau_M(D)=n.","display":true}],"bytes":1871,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-456","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-matchedcover|thm-matchedcover — Quadratic zero equations and minimum vertex covers]]"}],"outgoing":["198879e40a0ec5d9"]}